1. Project Objective

The objective of this project is to build a Python tool that analyzes safe sample phishing emails and extracts Indicators of Compromise (IOCs) in a structured way. Phishing emails often contain valuable evidence — suspicious URLs, look-alike domains, IP addresses, hashes, and header mismatches — that must be identified quickly and consistently during incident triage.

This tool automates the first stage of phishing analysis: parsing the email, extracting IOCs, and flagging basic risk indicators — without ever clicking a link, opening an attachment, or contacting any external system.

